  - m_Id: 10790502489489408
    m_Localized: Data Collection Notice for a Better Gaming Experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10790558126931968
    m_Localized: 'UNLOAD collects gameplay data using Unity Analytics to provide
      a more stable and enjoyable gaming experience.



      The collected information
      may include the following:



      - Collected Data: Device and execution
      environment information, game progress, play records, and error and crash information.

      -
      Purpose of Collection: In-game error analysis, game balance adjustments, content
      improvements, and service quality enhancement.



      The collected information
      is used solely for analysis purposes to improve the game, and we do not collect
      personal information that can directly identify users.



      You can find
      more details in the documents below.


      <link="https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/4911370/view/715660216997250625"><color=#00B0F0><u>Privacy
      Policy</u></color></link>

      <link="https://unity.com/legal/privacy-policy"><color=#00B0F0><u>Unity
      Privacy Policy</u></color></link>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
